flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open transaction form]
    B --> C[Choose Income or Expense]
    C --> D[Enter amount, date, category, description]
    D --> E{Required fields valid?}
    E -- No --> F[Show validation errors]
    F --> D
    E -- Yes --> G{Amount greater than zero?}
    G -- No --> H[Show amount error]
    H --> D
    G -- Yes --> I[Submit transaction]
    I --> J[Service validates business rules]
    J --> K[Save transaction]
    K --> L[Recalculate dashboard totals and balance]
    L --> M[Refresh selected date and transaction list]
    M --> N([End])
